ctx-sift-codec contains the unmodified Sift codec and tokenizer library.

Public source: https://github.com/ctxrs/sift
Revision: 4d987c2038882d720acf704b321dd3f62f2a6f78
Upstream version: 0.4.0
License: MIT (the original license text is preserved in LICENSE).

Selected sources, preserved byte-for-byte:
  src/lib.rs
  src/json_codec.rs
  src/json_length.rs
  src/text_codec.rs
  src/text_lines.rs
  src/text_refs.rs
  src/text_symbols.rs
  src/tokenizer.rs
  src/tokenizer_data.rs
  build.rs
  tests/tokenizer.rs

The package manifest and build integration are maintained by ctx. The public
library API, codec formats, tokenizer, and selected tests are unchanged.

NOTICE-tokenizer.md preserves the complete upstream THIRD_PARTY_TOKENIZER.md
verbatim, including adapted-source, archive, and vocabulary attribution.
